    - "4 boards (CourseScoreboard, ContentFrictionBoard, HealthStrip, DifficultyTurnsBoard)"
    - "InsightsView host + /admin/insights route + AdminTopBar tab"
  verified:
    - "pnpm --filter player-vue typecheck — PASSES (0 errors)"
